{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_and_thread/","result":{"data":{"cur":{"id":"b7668856-9932-5657-8202-0053262ca4ce","html":"<h1 id=\"프로세스--스레드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4--%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"프로세스  스레드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>프로세스 &#x26; 스레드</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"정의\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%A0%95%EC%9D%98\" aria-label=\"정의 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>정의</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 580px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 68.88888888888889%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"프로세스와 스레드 구조\"\n        title=\"프로세스와 스레드 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/b6272/process_and_thread.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/e9ff0/process_and_thread.png 180w,\n/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/f21e7/process_and_thread.png 360w,\n/static/8a15b0ffe792537083f48288cccc16a9/b6272/process_and_thread.png 580w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 580px) 100vw, 580px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Process</strong> = 독립적인 실행 단위(실행 중에 있는 프로그램)<br>\n<strong>Thread</strong> = 프로세스 내부에서 실행되는 작은 실행 단위</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"process\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#process\" aria-label=\"process permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Process</h2>\n<h3 id=\"구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>구조</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 66.66666666666666%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"프로세스 구조\"\n        title=\"프로세스 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/37523/process.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/e9ff0/process.png 180w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/f21e7/process.png 360w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/37523/process.png 720w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/302a4/process.png 1080w,\n/static/3dfa04c877e15698ce2e521b0a85614d/2cefc/process.png 1400w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p>→ code, data, stack, heap 독립적으로 할당\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"특징\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95\" aria-label=\"특징 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>독립성</strong> : 각 프로세스는 고유한 메모리 공간과 리소스를 가지며, 다른 프로세스의 메모리나 리소스에 직접 접근할 수 없음  </li>\n<li><strong>오류 격리</strong> : 하나의 프로세스에서 오류나 충돌이 발생해도 다른 프로세스에 영향을 주지 않음  </li>\n<li><strong>통신</strong> : 파이프, 소켓, 메시지 큐와 같은 IPC를 사용하여 서로 통신함  </li>\n<li><strong>생성 부하</strong> : 리소스가 많이 들고 시간이 오래 걸림<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"thread\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#thread\" aria-label=\"thread permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Thread</h2>\n<h3 id=\"구조-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0-1\" aria-label=\"구조 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>구조</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 26.111111111111107%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"스레드 구조\"\n        title=\"스레드 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/37523/thread.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/e9ff0/thread.png 180w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/f21e7/thread.png 360w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/37523/thread.png 720w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/302a4/thread.png 1080w,\n/static/a9cc81d5455237ad2b3eb845ac3d7b0c/21b4d/thread.png 1280w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p>→ stack만 할당받아 복사하고 code, data, heap은 프로세스내의 다른 스레드들과 공유\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"특징-1\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%8A%B9%EC%A7%95-1\" aria-label=\"특징 1 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>특징</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>독립성:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내 스레드는 동일한 메모리 공간을 공유하므로 서로의 데이터에 직접 접근하고 수정할 수 있음   </li>\n<li><strong>오류 격리:</strong> 스레드 내에서 오류가 발생하면 동일한 프로세스 내 다른 스레드에도 영향을 미칠 수 있음</li>\n<li><strong>통신:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내 스레드는 메모리를 공유하기에 쉽게 통신할 수 있음  </li>\n<li><strong>생성 부하:</strong> 동일한 프로세스 내의 스레드는 프로세스의 리소스를 공유하므로 생성 부하가 적음\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"다중-프로세스-vs-다중-스레드\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-vs-%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C\" aria-label=\"다중 프로세스 vs 다중 스레드 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 프로세스 VS 다중 스레드</h2>\n<h3 id=\"다중-프로세스-multi-process\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-multi-process\" aria-label=\"다중 프로세스 multi process permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 프로세스 (Multi-process)</h3>\n<p>하나의 응용 프로그램에 대해 동시에 여러 개의 프로세스를 실행할 수 있게 하는 것</p>\n<h3 id=\"다중-스레드-multi-threaded\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EB%8B%A4%EC%A4%91-%EC%8A%A4%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-multi-threaded\" aria-label=\"다중 스레드 multi threaded permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>다중 스레드 (Multi-threaded)</h3>\n<p>하나의 프로세스 안에 여러 개의 스레드를 실행할 수 있게 하는 것  </p>\n<br>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th><strong>다중 프로세스</strong></th>\n<th><strong>다중 스레드</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>안정성</strong></td>\n<td>다른 프로세스에 영향 X</td>\n<td>충돌 가능성 O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>확장성</strong></td>\n<td>확장성 제공</td>\n<td>확장성 제한</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>문맥 교환 부하</strong></td>\n<td>별도의 메모리 공간 → 오버헤드 ↑</td>\n<td>메모리 공유 → 오버헤드 ↓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>자원 공유 비효율성</strong></td>\n<td>IPC 필요 → 효율성 ↓</td>\n<td>메모리 공유 → 효율성 ↑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%E2%9A%94%EF%B8%8F-%EC%93%B0%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%E2%9A%94%EF%B8%8F-%EC%93%B0%EB%A0%88%EB%93%9C-%EC%B0%A8%EC%9D%B4</a><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-multi-process-multi-thread\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/%F0%9F%91%A9%E2%80%8D%F0%9F%92%BB-multi-process-multi-thread</a></p>","excerpt":"프로세스 & 스레드  정의    Process = 독립적인 실행 단위(실행 중에 있는 프로그램) Thread = 프로세스 내부에서 실행되는 작은 실행 단위  Process 구조    → code, data, stack, heap 독립적으로 할당\n 특징 독립성 : 각 프로세스는 고유한 메모리 공간과 리소스를 가지며, 다른 프로세스의 메모리나 리소스에 직접 접근할 수 없음   오류 격리 : 하나의 프로세스에서 오류나 충돌이 발생해도 다른 프로세스에 영향을 주지 않음   통신 : 파이프, 소켓, 메시지 큐와 같은 IPC를 사용하여 서로 통신함   생성 부하 : 리소스가 많이 들고 시간이 오래 걸림  Thread 구조    → stack만 할당받아 복사하고 code, data, heap은 프로세스내의 다른 스레드들과 공유\n 특징 독립성: 동일한 프로세스 내 스레드는 동일한 메모리 공간을 공유하므로 서로의 데이터에 직접 접근하고 수정할 수 있음    오류 격리: 스레드 내에서 오류가 발생하…","frontmatter":{"date":"August 14, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 프로세스 & 스레드","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_and_thread/"}},"next":{"id":"710f79e6-640c-55ed-bdf4-69ddf862e49a","html":"<h1 id=\"프로세스-주소-공간\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%ED%94%84%EB%A1%9C%EC%84%B8%EC%8A%A4-%EC%A3%BC%EC%86%8C-%EA%B3%B5%EA%B0%84\" aria-label=\"프로세스 주소 공간 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>프로세스 주소 공간</h1>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"구조\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EA%B5%AC%EC%A1%B0\" aria-label=\"구조 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>구조</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 510px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 148.33333333333334%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"프로세스 주소 공간 구조\"\n        title=\"프로세스 주소 공간 구조\"\n        src=\"/static/22321c86cf07d4a60dccb8d83ed3c72f/0abdd/process_address_space.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/22321c86cf07d4a60dccb8d83ed3c72f/e9ff0/process_address_space.png 180w,\n/static/22321c86cf07d4a60dccb8d83ed3c72f/f21e7/process_address_space.png 360w,\n/static/22321c86cf07d4a60dccb8d83ed3c72f/0abdd/process_address_space.png 510w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<h3 id=\"code-text-영역\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#code-text-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD\" aria-label=\"code text 영역 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>code (text) 영역</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>CPU가 해석 가능한 기계어 형태로 프로그램 코드가 저장되어 있는 공간  </li>\n<li>Read-Only (프로그램 수정 방지)  </li>\n<li>같은 프로그램으로 실행된 여러 프로세스는 동일한 코드<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"data-영역\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#data-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD\" aria-label=\"data 영역 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>data 영역</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>코드가 실행되면서 사용하는 전역 변수, 정적 변수 데이터가 저장되어 있는 공간  </li>\n<li>프로그램 시작과 함께 할당, 프로그램 종료 시 소멸<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"stack-영역\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#stack-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD\" aria-label=\"stack 영역 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>stack 영역</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>지역 변수, 매개변수 등 호출한 함수가 종료되면 되돌아올 임시적인 자료를 저장하는 독립적인 공간  </li>\n<li>함수 호출과 함께 할당, 함수 호출 완료 시 소멸  </li>\n<li>메모리의 높은 주소 → 낮은 주소로 할당  </li>\n<li>함수가 stack 영역을 초과하면 stack overflow 에러 발생<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"heap-영역\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#heap-%EC%98%81%EC%97%AD\" aria-label=\"heap 영역 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>heap 영역</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>생성자, 인스턴스와 같이 동적으로 할당되는 데이터들을 저장하는 공간  </li>\n<li>런타임에 따라 크기 결정  </li>\n<li>동적으로 할당 / 해제  </li>\n<li>메모리의 낮은 주소 → 높은 주소로 할당  </li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 14, 2023","title":"[CS] 운영체제 - 프로세스 주소 공간","categories":"CS","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_address_space/"}},"prev":{"id":"8a57be77-efc1-56fb-ad89-2cf8ad7c6df5","html":"<h1 id=\"async--await\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async--await\" aria-label=\"async  await permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async &#x26; await</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code class=\"language-text\">AsyncFunction</code>객체를 반환하는 하나의 비동기 함수를 정의합니다. 비동기 함수는 이벤트 루프를 통해 비동기적으로 작동하는 함수로, 암시적으로 <code class=\"language-text\">Promise</code>를 사용하여 결과를 반환합니다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\">  <span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token operator\">...</span> param<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        statements\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p>→ Promise의 단점을 보완해주는 비동기 처리 방식</p>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"async\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#async\" aria-label=\"async permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>함수 선언 시 <strong>함수</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">async</code>  </li>\n<li>promise 객체 반환<br>\n<br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"awiat\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#awiat\" aria-label=\"awiat permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>awiat</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>promise 객체</strong> 앞에 <code class=\"language-text\">await</code>  </li>\n<li>promise가 완료될 때까지 대기  </li>\n<li>async 함수 내부에서만 사용 가능<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"사용\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9\" aria-label=\"사용 permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>사용</h2>\n<p>await 키워드를 붙인 비동기 작업이 완료될 때까지 대기했다가 다음 작업을 수행한다.  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">ms</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">Promise</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">resolve</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token function\">setTimeout</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>resolve<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> ms<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 1'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">delay</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token number\">3000</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Task 2'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token function\">example</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 506px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.333333333333336%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        title=\"async &amp; await 사용 예시\"\n        src=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/e9ff0/async_and_await_example.png 180w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/f21e7/async_and_await_example.png 360w,\n/static/33853ca07e0ff851e8a0b22f3ab32060/29f4e/async_and_await_example.png 506w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 506px) 100vw, 506px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<p><br><br><br></p>\n<h2 id=\"promise-vs-asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise-vs-asyncawait\" aria-label=\"promise vs asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise VS async/await</h2>\n<h3 id=\"promise\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#promise\" aria-label=\"promise permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Promise</h3>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 720px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 43.888888888888886%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        title=\"promise hell 예시 코드\"\n        src=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/e9ff0/promise_hell.png 180w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/f21e7/promise_hell.png 360w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/37523/promise_hell.png 720w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/302a4/promise_hell.png 1080w,\n/static/c5d54c974812fca69693618059c0ee5c/bb072/promise_hell.png 1318w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 720px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n      />\n    </span>  </p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">postId</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Post:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">then</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">result</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'Comments:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">catch</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">error</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=></span> console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ promise 체이닝으로 인한 <code class=\"language-text\">.then() 지옥</code>의 가능성 (가독성 저하)<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">.catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링<br>\n<br><br></p>\n<h3 id=\"asyncawait\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#asyncawait\" aria-label=\"asyncawait permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>async/await</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> postId_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getPost</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postNum<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> comments_result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">await</span> <span class=\"token function\">getComments</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"Post:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> postId_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Comments:\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> comments_result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\tconsole<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  \n<span class=\"token function\">getResult</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>→ <code class=\"language-text\">.then()</code> 중첩 없이 간결하게 표현 가능<br>\n→ <code class=\"language-text\">try-catch()</code>문을 통해 에러 핸들링 (에러 발생 위치 알기 쉬움)<br>\n→ 비동기 작업 흐름을 명확하게 보여줌  </p>\n<h3 id=\"try-catch\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#try-catch\" aria-label=\"try catch permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>try-catch</h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"jsx\"><pre class=\"language-jsx\"><code class=\"language-jsx\"><span class=\"token keyword\">try</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 예외가 발생할 수 있는 코드</span>\n  <span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> result <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">exampleFunction</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">log</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">catch</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>error<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token comment\">// 오류 처리를 위한 코드</span>\n  console<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">error</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'오류가 발생했습니다:'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> error<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>message<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div>\n<ol>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내에서 예외/오류가 발생 → 해당 블록 내 코드 실행 즉시 중단, 해당 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록으로 이동 (<code class=\"language-text\">try</code> 블록 내 오류가 없을 경우 <code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 건너뛰고 계속 진행)  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 내의 코드 실행  </li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">catch</code> 블록 실행 후, 이후 프로그램 계속 진행<br>\n<br><br><br></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>references</strong><br>\n👉 <a href=\"https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await\">https://inpa.tistory.com/entry/JS-%F0%9F%93%9A-%EB%B9%84%EB%8F%99%EA%B8%B0%EC%B2%98%EB%A6%AC-async-await</a></p>","frontmatter":{"date":"August 16, 2023","title":"[Web] JS - async & await","categories":"Web","author":"JSH99","emoji":"📚"},"fields":{"slug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/"}},"site":{"siteMetadata":{"siteUrl":"https://www.jsh99.com","comments":{"utterances":{"repo":"JSH99/JSH99.github.io"}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_and_thread/","nextSlug":"/CS/OperatingSystem/process_address_space/","prevSlug":"/Web/JS/async_and_await/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["1073350324","2938748437"]}